        <extension url="http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/valueset-rules-text">
          <valueMarkdown value="https://mor.nlm.nih.gov/RxMix/ Script:&#xD;&#xA;Step 1 &#xD;&#xA;Create Batch text input file (SCT-785276005.txt) with following SCT identifier (for the concept &quot;Product containing amfetamine and/or amfetamine derivative (product)&quot;) as an input within the file: &#xD;&#xA;785276005       &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Step 2&#xD;&#xA;Submit batch job using the above SCT-Opioids.txt file to following workflow by uploading the config file (Amphetamine-class-meds.config) with the following in the file:  &lt;WFE&gt;&lt;filteredOutputs&gt;RXCUI|name|term_type&lt;/filteredOutputs&gt;&lt;input&gt;NOINPUT&lt;/input&gt;&lt;FS&gt;&lt;service&gt;NOINPUT&lt;/service&gt;&lt;function&gt;getClassMembers&lt;/function&gt;&lt;level&gt;0&lt;/level&gt;&lt;paramSize&gt;5&lt;/paramSize&gt;&lt;param order ='0'&gt;?&lt;/param&gt;&lt;param order ='1'&gt;SNOMEDCT&lt;/param&gt;&lt;param order ='2'&gt;isa_structure&lt;/param&gt;&lt;param order ='3'&gt;0&lt;/param&gt;&lt;param order ='4'&gt;IN,MIN,PIN&lt;/param&gt;&lt;/FS&gt;&lt;FS&gt;&lt;service&gt;NOINPUT&lt;/service&gt;&lt;function&gt;getRelatedByType&lt;/function&gt;&lt;level&gt;1&lt;/level&gt;&lt;paramSize&gt;2&lt;/paramSize&gt;&lt;param order ='0'&gt;?&lt;/param&gt;&lt;param order ='1'&gt;BPCK,GPCK,SBD,SCD&lt;/param&gt;&lt;/FS&gt;&lt;/WFE&gt;&#xD;&#xA;This will produce a result file with all Amphetamine-class clinical drugs included"/>
        </extension>
        <url value="http://fhir.org/guides/cdc/opioid-cds/ValueSet/amphetamines-class-medications"/>
