        <extension url="http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/valueset-rules-text">
          <valueMarkdown value="https://mor.nlm.nih.gov/RxMix/ &#xD;&#xA;Script:&#xD;&#xA;Step 1 &#xD;&#xA;Create Batch text input file (Naloxone.txt) with following RxNorm identifier for the ingredient (TTY=IN) as the only concept within the file: &#xD;&#xA;7242       &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Step 2&#xD;&#xA;Submit batch job using the above Naloxone.txt as the input file to following workflow by uploading a workflow file (naloxone-wf.config) with the following text in the file:  &lt;WFE&gt;&lt;filteredOutputs&gt;RXCUI|name|term_type&lt;/filteredOutputs&gt;&lt;input&gt;NOINPUT&lt;/input&gt;&lt;FS&gt;&lt;service&gt;NOINPUT&lt;/service&gt;&lt;function&gt;getRelatedByType&lt;/function&gt;&lt;level&gt;0&lt;/level&gt;&lt;paramSize&gt;2&lt;/paramSize&gt;&lt;param order ='0'&gt;?&lt;/param&gt;&lt;param order ='1'&gt;BPCK,GPCK,SBD,SCD&lt;/param&gt;&lt;/FS&gt;&lt;/WFE&gt;"/>
        </extension>
